===== proxxx suspend --help =====
Suspend a running guest (freeze vCPUs to RAM). Pair with `resume`. QEMU + LXC. Non-destructive — the guest holds memory until you resume. To checkpoint to disk instead, use the QEMU monitor directly (out of MVP scope)

