===== proxxx incident --help =====
Incident-response primitives — cluster-wide write kill-switch. `freeze` halts every mutation entry point; `thaw` lifts it; `status` reports current state. Reads keep working

Usage: proxxx incident [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  freeze  Freeze writes — every mutation entry point refuses until you `thaw` (or the TTL expires)
  thaw    Lift the freeze. Idempotent — thawing when nothing is frozen is a no-op (returns `null`)
  status  Report the current freeze status — the global freeze plus any per-profile freezes, each with metadata. Exits 0 either way — use `--format json` and match on `active` for scripting
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Connection profile name

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (only in CLI mode)

          Possible values:
          - json
          - json-envelope: JSON wrapped in a envelope carrying the producing version (audit 2026-09-09, #284)
          - table
          - plain
          
          [default: table]

