===== proxxx describe --help =====
Structured cluster digest — one command, four formats. The `--output llm-context` variant is designed to paste at the top of an LLM chat: token-compact, prose+key:value mix, no markdown tables. Secrets are NEVER emitted regardless of flag

Usage: proxxx describe [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --output <OUTPUT>
          Output format. `llm-context` is the compact-prose variant designed to paste at the top of an LLM conversation
          
          [default: text]
          [possible values: text, md, json, llm-context]

      --include <INCLUDE>
          Optional sections to add. Repeatable. `all` is a shortcut for `events,rbac`
          
          [possible values: events, rbac, all]

      --profile <PROFILE>
          Connection profile name

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (only in CLI mode)

