===== proxxx watch --help =====
Watch for cluster changes or wait for a condition

Usage: proxxx watch [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --since <SINCE>
          Show guest changes since a time ago, from the local state cache: a number with unit s, m, h, d or w (e.g. 30m, 6h, 1d)

  -t, --target <TARGET>
          Target to watch: vm-<id> (or a bare <id>), storage-<id>, or storage-<id>@<node> for a node-local storage

  -u, --until <UNTIL>
          Wait until condition is met: status=running|stopped|paused|suspended for a guest, usage=<70%, usage=>80% or usage=75% for storage

      --timeout <TIMEOUT>
          Abort watching after this many seconds (default 300)
          
          [default: 300]

  -n, --notify <NOTIFY>
          Channel to notify when condition is met (e.g. telegram)

