===== proxxx disk --help =====
Live disk operations (move between storage / grow). Destructive — requires `--yes`. Always routes through Proxmox API directly (CLI does not enqueue; the queue is a TUI concept)

Usage: proxxx disk [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  move    Move a disk to a different storage backend
  resize  Resize a disk. Proxmox forbids shrinking — `size` must be larger
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Connection profile name

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (only in CLI mode)

          Possible values:
