===== proxxx pbs --help =====
Proxmox Backup Server: list snapshots and restore archives. Read-only browse via REST API; restore shells out to `proxmox-backup-client` (Linux required)

Usage: proxxx pbs [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  ping        Verify PBS connectivity and authentication. Prints PBS version on success
  datastores  List datastores on the configured PBS server
  snapshots   List snapshots in a datastore. Optional filters by guest type/id
  files       List archive files inside a specific snapshot
  restore     Restore an archive to a local target directory. By default the whole archive is extracted; pass one or more `--pattern` globs to restore only matching files/subdirs (single-file restore), e.g. `--pattern etc/network/interfaces`. Matched files land under `--target` preserving their in-archive path
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

