          `ACCEPT` | `REJECT` | `DROP` (case-sensitive on PVE)

      --policy-out <POLICY_OUT>
          

      --ebtables <EBTABLES>
          [possible values: true, false]

      --log-ratelimit <LOG_RATELIMIT>
