===== proxxx cluster-mapping --help =====
Cluster hardware mapping — stable logical names for PCI / USB passthrough devices. Lets a guest keep its passthrough binding across migrations between hosts where the device sits at a different bus address

Usage: proxxx cluster-mapping [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  pci   PCI device mappings: one name for the same device on several nodes
  usb   USB device mappings: one name for the same device on several nodes
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Connection profile name

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (only in CLI mode)

          Possible values:
