===== proxxx cluster-mapping pci --help =====
PCI device mappings: one name for the same device on several nodes

Usage: proxxx cluster-mapping pci [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List the PCI mappings
  create  Create a new PCI mapping. The `--map` arg accepts the wire format PVE expects, e.g. `--map "node=pve1,path=0000:01:00.0,id=10de:2684,iommugroup=13"`. Repeat once per cluster node
  update  Update a PCI mapping. Each `--map` is one node's device; when given, they replace the mapping's node list
  delete  Delete a PCI mapping. Requires `--yes`
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Connection profile name

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (only in CLI mode)

