===== proxxx node-system syslog --help =====
Page through the node's syslog, oldest line first.

Without `--start` or `--since` PVE starts at the first line since boot, not at the end (measured on PVE 9.1.1, audit #385). Lines are numbered for paging. For the newest lines use `node-system <node> journal --lastentries <n>`.

Usage: proxxx node-system <NODE> syslog [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --start <START>
          1-indexed start cursor — pass back the last `n` from the previous response to paginate forward

      --limit <LIMIT>
          

      --since <SINCE>
          

      --until <UNTIL>
          

      --service <SERVICE>
          

      --profile <PROFILE>
          Connection profile name

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (only in CLI mode)

          Possible values:
          - json
          - json-envelope: JSON wrapped in a envelope carrying the producing version (audit 2026-09-09, #284)
