===== proxxx node-system subscription --help =====
Subscription state + key management

Usage: proxxx node-system <NODE> subscription [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  get      Show current subscription state — status, level, due date
  set      Set the subscription key. PVE validates against the licensing server inline; failure surfaces as an API error
  refresh  Force re-validate of the existing key (e.g. after a network blip)
  delete   Remove the subscription key. Destructive — requires `--yes`
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Connection profile name

