===== proxxx node-system cert --help =====
pveproxy TLS certificates — list, upload custom, delete custom, order ACME

Usage: proxxx node-system <NODE> cert [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  info        List currently-served certs (filename, fingerprint, expiry, SAN)
  upload      Upload an operator-managed cert + key (writes to `pveproxy-ssl.{pem,key}`)
  delete      Remove the operator-uploaded custom cert
  acme-order  Trigger ACME order/renewal. Returns a UPID (long task — DNS-01 / HTTP-01 round-trips with the CA)
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Connection profile name

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (only in CLI mode)

          Possible values:
          - json
          - json-envelope: JSON wrapped in a envelope carrying the producing version (audit 2026-09-09, #284)
