===== proxxx notifications endpoint --help =====
Notification endpoints: where notifications are delivered (`sendmail`, `smtp`, `gotify`, `webhook`)

Usage: proxxx notifications endpoint [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list    List all configured endpoints across all types
  create  Create an endpoint. Type-specific knobs go via `--raw KEY=VAL` (e.g. for smtp: `--raw server=mail.example.com --raw from=…`; for gotify: `--raw server=https://gotify.example.com --raw token=…`)
  update  Update an endpoint; only the flags passed are sent
  delete  Delete an endpoint. Requires `--yes`
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

