          Repeatable — `field=pattern` clauses (e.g. `type=vzdump`)

      --match-severity <MATCH_SEVERITY>
          Repeatable — severity filters (`error`, `warning`, etc.)

      --mode <MODE>
          `all` (default) | `any`

      --invert-match <INVERT_MATCH>
          [possible values: true, false]

      --comment <COMMENT>
          

