===== proxxx cluster-bootstrap --help =====
Corosync cluster bootstrap — node membership, join info, quorum-device, totem transport. Rare day-to-day but high-stakes (botched qdevice or node add can lose quorum and freeze HA)

Usage: proxxx cluster-bootstrap [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  nodes    Corosync cluster membership
  join     Join a node to an existing cluster
  qdevice  The corosync quorum device (`QDevice`)
  totem    Inspect corosync totem transport config (read-only — totem changes go through `/etc/pve/corosync.conf` editing)
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

