===== proxxx cluster-bootstrap join --help =====
Join a node to an existing cluster

Usage: proxxx cluster-bootstrap join [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  info  Fetch the join data + totem config + cert fingerprint a new node needs to join. PVE 8+ requires `--node` (the new node's intended name)
  join  Actually join an existing cluster from the new-node side. Needs the target cluster's hostname + a root password + the cert fingerprint (use `info` on the target side first). Returns a UPID — corosync restart involved
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

