===== proxxx token --help =====
API token management (list / create / revoke)

Usage: proxxx token [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list       List tokens for a user
  create     Create a new token. The secret is printed ONCE — capture it, proxxx can't recover it later
  revoke     Revoke a token. Required: `--yes`
  bootstrap  Bootstrap a new API token over SSH (`pveum`), grant an ACL role, and store the secret directly in a `0600` file or OS keychain without ever printing it (`#330`)
  help       Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>
          Connection profile name

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (only in CLI mode)

          Possible values:
          - json
